      "content": "idk. i dont think talking helps because there is no one really here to talk. it's like i'm just a hollow shell watching a movie of a life i used to have. if the person who actually lived that life is already gone... what am i even protecting? it feels like trying to save a house that's already burned down to ash. it just feels more logical to let it go than to keep pretending i'm still in there.",
